 - one button (R / L3) packs gold, crates and the wagon. Gear never moves. Upgrade details on controller - effect, cost and requirements in a strip at the bottom. The Tinker - a new rest-stop vendor with cheap socket tools. Heroes Du","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T16:46:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687418","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4936700-1846018067945069","game_id":"steam-4936700","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.9.7 UI Rework","summary":"Caravan Survivors Demo – Update 0.9.7New StuffNew Town ScreenNew Contract ScreenNew Town Upgrade ScreenMultiple New Town Upgrades organized into Structure, Defense, Turrets, Heroes, Fortune and Magic.Last Contract Tier is new remembered. Easier to get back into the action.Changes/FixesVarious fixesContract/Road re roll removed.Readability and Flow improvementsGamepad/Steam Deck improvements.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T18:57:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067945069","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4936700-1846018067941931","game_id":"steam-4936700","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.9.6.0 - Luck Rework","summary":"Caravan Survivors Demo – Update 0.9.6New StuffSend Feedback button: on the main menu, the pause menu and the end of the demo. It opens a short, anonymous survey with no sign-in and no email. We read every one!Battering Ram (Town upgrade, after Rush): adds contact damage, and throttling up to Rush or Full Tilt makes your caravan invulnerable for a moment. Barrel straight through enemys.Road boons, simplified: a road can now carry one of four bonuses: more XP, more Luck, more damage or better cont","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T18:08:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941931","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4936700-1846018067929855","game_id":"steam-4936700","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.9.5.0 - Ice Mage + Chill Reworked","summary":"Caravan Survivors 0.9.5-beta Notable Changes:New Hero: Ice Mage (4 rarities)Chill/Shatter reworked and buffed. Banish: remove an unwanted upgrade from your level-up offersElemental SocketsNew UpgradesNew Contract ModifiersBoss Chests reworked.Show Abilities context menu on Hero Beds.Cargo box fixes.New QuestsTown cargo prices swing nerfed. Based on last contract.Boss fixes.End of day repair buffedHero and boss balance passInventory screen and level-up menu cleanupVarious Bug fixes.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T14:12:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929855","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4936700-1844751498234637","game_id":"steam-4936700","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.9.4.2","summary":"Small Update v0.9.4.2Save and Exit freeze fixSocket Re rolls let you keep the previous option.Added chest and socket re rolls. Max of 3, escalating costs increased by luck.Shop price fixes.Cargo Effects on contract screen now only shows run related modifiers as intended.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T15:32:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498234637","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":